@adminToken = REPLACE_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN
@host = http://localhost:5172
@productId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@orderId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@adjustmentId = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Initialize stock for an active Catalog product.
POST {{host}}/api/inventory/stock
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 100 }

### Stock balance.
GET {{host}}/api/inventory/stock/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Paginated low stock.
GET {{host}}/api/inventory/stock?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20&maxAvailable=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Restock; reuse adjustmentId only when retrying this exact adjustment.
POST {{host}}/api/inventory/stock/{{productId}}/adjustments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "requestId": "{{adjustmentId}}", "delta": 25, "reason": "Supplier delivery" }

### Adjustment history.
GET {{host}}/api/inventory/stock/{{productId}}/adjustments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Reserve stock for an order (normally called by Order).
POST {{host}}/api/inventory/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderId": "{{orderId}}", "items": [{ "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 2 }] }

### Reservation details.
GET {{host}}/api/inventory/reservations/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Reservation list.
GET {{host}}/api/inventory/reservations?status=Reserved
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Commit reserved units (normally called by Order).
POST {{host}}/api/inventory/reservations/{{orderId}}/commit
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Release reserved units or restore committed units (normally called by Order).
POST {{host}}/api/inventory/reservations/{{orderId}}/release
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Readiness.
GET {{host}}/health/ready
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
